<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="how-section" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Process</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Simple as a Cup of Coffee.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">No lengthy profiles. No endless waiting. Just five simple steps to a real conversation with someone new.</p>

    <!-- TIMING BANNER -->
    <div style="background:var(--espresso);border-radius:16px;padding:1.2rem 2rem;margin-bottom:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="font-size:2rem;">⏱️</div>
      <div>
        <h4 style="color:#f5c267;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Session Duration: 30 to 40 Minutes</h4>
        <p style="color:#c8b49a;font-size:0.85rem;">Your reserved table time is <strong style="color:#fff">30–40 minutes</strong>. After that, you are free to continue your conversation, order food or more drinks, and stay as long as you like — at your own expense.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div class="step-icon">📍</div>
        <h4>Pick a Café</h4>
        <p>Choose a partner café near you and scan their unique QR code to register your profile for that venue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div class="step-icon">💳</div>
        <h4>Pay ₹349</h4>
        <p>One session fee. Covers your match, a coffee coupon worth ₹100, coordination and on-ground support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div class="step-icon">🎟️</div>
        <h4>Get Your Coffee Coupon</h4>
        <p>After payment you instantly receive a <strong>₹100 coupon</strong> on your email. Show it at the café to redeem one free coffee or beverage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <div class="step-icon">🤝</div>
        <h4>Get Matched</h4>
        <p>Our team pairs you with the most interesting person registered at the same café and time slot.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">05</div>
        <div class="step-icon">☕</div>
        <h4>Show Up & Talk</h4>
        <p>Walk in, redeem your coupon, enjoy a 30–40 min conversation. Loved it? Stay longer and order more on your own!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- COUPON EXPLAINER -->
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed var(--caramel);border-radius:16px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem;">🎟️</div>
        <div>
          <h4 style="color:var(--espresso);font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">For You — The Customer</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;">Pay ₹349. Get a ₹100 coffee coupon sent to your email. Walk in, redeem, meet someone new. Simple.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed var(--caramel);border-radius:16px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem;">🏪</div>
        <div>
          <h4 style="color:var(--espresso);font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">For the Café Owner</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;">Every CWS session brings 2 customers with a ₹100 coupon each — guaranteed ₹200 minimum spend, plus extra orders if they stay longer.</p>
        </div>
