      <div style="margin-top:1rem;padding:1rem;background:#fdf3e4;border:1.5px dashed var(--caramel);border-radius:12px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);">
        🎟️ Your <strong style="color:var(--espresso)">₹100 Coffee Coupon</strong> will be sent to your email after payment. Show it at the café to redeem your free coffee!
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:0.8rem;padding:1rem;background:var(--foam);border-radius:12px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">
        ⏱️ Your session is <strong style="color:var(--espresso)">30–40 minutes</strong>. Show up 5 minutes early. Be yourself. That's all.
