<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Got Questions?</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can I choose who I get matched with?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">You can share your interests, profession, and what you're looking for in a conversation. Our team uses this to find you the most interesting possible match at your chosen café.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Why does each café have a different QR code?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">The QR ties your registration to a specific venue and time slot — so you're only matched with someone who will actually be sitting in the same café as you. No confusion, no mix-ups.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What does the ₹399 cover?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">It covers your match, coordination, and our team's support before and during your session. Your coffee or snacks are ordered separately at the café — that's between you and the menu!</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is this a dating service?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">No. Coffee With Stranger is about real human connection — friendships, conversations, and community. All sessions happen in public cafés with verified profiles. Romantic connections are not the goal, though great friendships absolutely are.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">When will sessions actually start?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Sessions will begin as soon as our first café partners are confirmed in Bengaluru. Register your interest now and you will be the first to know — and the first to get matched.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LIST YOUR CAFÉ -->
<section class="list-section" id="list-cafe">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">For Café Owners</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Own a Café in Bangalore?<br/>Join Our Network.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">We bring verified, conversation-ready customers to your café. No upfront cost. Just more footfall and a great story to tell.</p>

    <div class="list-grid">
      <div class="list-benefits">
        <div class="list-benefit">
          <div class="list-benefit-icon">📈</div>
          <div>
            <h4>More Customers, Guaranteed</h4>
            <p>Every session we run at your café brings in 2 paying customers who stay for at least an hour.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="list-benefit">
          <div class="list-benefit-icon">🎯</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Zero Cost to Join</h4>
            <p>Listing your café is completely free. We earn only from bookings — your café earns from food & drinks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="list-benefit">
          <div class="list-benefit-icon">📍</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Your Own QR Code</h4>
            <p>Once approved, you get a unique QR code to display. Customers scan it, register, and meet right at your venue.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="list-benefit">
          <div class="list-benefit-icon">🌆</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Open to All Bangalore Cafés</h4>
            <p>Any café, any neighbourhood — Jayanagar, HSR, JP Nagar, MG Road — if you have seating, you qualify.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="list-form-card">
        <h4>List Your Café</h4>
        <p>Fill this in and we'll reach out within 48 hours.</p>

        <div id="listFormWrap">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Café Name</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="The Corner Brew" id="cafeName"/>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Your Name (Owner / Manager)</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Suresh Kumar" id="ownerName"/>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Phone Number</label>
              <input type="tel" placeholder="+91 98765 43210" id="ownerPhone"/>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Email</label>
              <input type="email" placeholder="cafe@example.com" id="ownerEmail"/>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Café Address (Area / Landmark)</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="5th Block, Koramangala, near Forum Mall" id="cafeAddress"/>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Opening Hours</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="8 AM – 10 PM" id="cafeHours"/>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Anything else you'd like us to know? <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:400">(optional)</span></label>
            <textarea placeholder="We have a quiet corner perfect for meetups..." style="height:60px;resize:none;" id="cafeNote"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button class="form-submit" onclick="submitCafeListing()">Submit Your Café →</button>
        </div>

        <div id="listSuccess" style="display:none;text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
          <div style="font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">🎉</div>
          <h4 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--success);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Application Received!</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;">We'll contact you at <strong id="listConfirmContact"></strong> within 48 hours to get you set up with your own QR code.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

